# Only web/ is served. Everything below is the engine, its dependencies and
# the deck build inputs. requirements.txt above all: without excluding it
# Vercel installs torch and the bundle hits 5.8 GB against a 250 MB limit.
#
# Every pattern is anchored with a leading slash. Without one, gitignore
# syntax matches at ANY depth - so "static/" would also kill web/static/,
# and "data/" would kill web/data/, which is exactly how the first deploy
# shipped with no stylesheet and no simulation data.
/.venv/
/snapshots/
/models/
/data/
/docs/
/legacy/
/app/
/scripts/
/templates/
/static/
/requirements.txt
/deck/clips/
/deck/stills/
/deck/shots/
/deck/fonts/
/deck/.flat/
__pycache__/
.DS_Store
